<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HELP</p><h1>Understanding a player profile</h1></section><section class="content-section narrow"><h2>Source labels</h2><p><strong>League verified</strong> and <strong>Tournament verified</strong> originate from linked Pocket Rankings products. <strong>Player reported</strong> is entered by the player. <strong>Community endorsed</strong> is acknowledged by an authorized local organizer.</p><h2>Linking records</h2><p>A name is never enough to connect records. Requests stay pending until a future verified Account and source handshake confirms that a local record belongs to the same person.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>Contact the organization that owns an official League or Tournament result. Profile managers cannot edit those source records here.</p></section>
